The TrenchR package as a whole is distributed under GPL (>= 3). The TrenchR
package includes other open source software components. The following is a list
of these components:

* nexcf: Code adapted from the R function nexcf, distributed to me by Kira
  Rehfeld, which is a translation of the original MATLAB code available in the
  NESToolbox (<https://tocsy.pik-potsdam.de/nest.php>): GPL-3
